Z||000003||Philphine||02-07-2001||02:18 AM||||hey count. try bachman chevrolet in louisville. a local pontiac dealer sent me there to get a cable for my izuzu 5 speed. i was told they have about the largest parts inventory in the area. i tried autozone too but they couldn't get it in, the order kept cancelling. bachman had it in stock. take the old one and be sure which tranny you have, cause they're not too familiar with them and you might end up with the wrong one. ||||reg||1
