Z||000005||Philphine||02-07-2001||12:05 PM||||no idea. maybe some number or marking on the tranny? if nothing else take the cable and match it up really well. the lenth and the way it clamps to the tranny (the little circular rings that fit in the clamps are different on mine. thats how i knew i got the wrong one when i got mine) will need to match. i was looking at the screen while he looked it up. i don't think any of the cables are interchangeable from one tranny to another. they seemed to have them all though so i guess multiple trips will be the main inconvenience if it's not the right one the first time.<P>also, that price sounds like the price for both cables. i don't think i paid half that.<P>||||reg||1
